LICENCE — NOT YET DECIDED
=========================

The licence for this repository is an OPEN DECISION, tracked in
.docs/README.md §Open items and in CLAUDE.md.

Context:
  - .docs/02-architecture/tech-stack.md commits to an open-source licence so the
    methodology itself is auditable. Public trust in this platform depends on
    that auditability.
  - AGPL-3.0 has well-known friction with Apple App Store distribution terms,
    which matters once apps/mobile ships (.docs/adr/001-mobile-framework.md).

Recommendation on file: Apache-2.0 or MPL-2.0, which preserve auditability
without the distribution conflict. Per-package licensing is also viable if the
project wants copyleft for the backend services.

This placeholder exists so the decision stays visible. Replace it with the
chosen licence text before any public release or store submission.
